,title,link,text,language,family
0,Dabarre language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dabarre_language,"Dabarre (also known as Af-Dabarre) is a Somali language spoken by the Dabarre and iroole, both clans of the Maqarre branch of the Samaale family of Somalis inhabiting southwestern Somalia. It has an estimated 75,000 speakers.",Dabarre,Afro-Asiatic
1,Dabare - Wikipedia,https://so.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dabare,"Dabarre ('''Af carabi''': دبر, Af ingiriis: Dabare】) waa qabiil ka mid ah qabiilada soomaalida oo degaan ku ah bariga afrika gaar ahaan soomaaliya, itoobiya, kenya iyo meelo kale oo ka mid ah geyiga afrika.",Dabarre,Afro-Asiatic
